<p style="color:#9aa4b2">below the trust line (BBB): speculative, unproven adoption or reliability.</p><p style="color:#9aa4b2">Tier held by the 2-point band: today's numbers alone would give CCC. A tier moves only when the score clears a threshold by 2 points (<a href="https://agenteconomy.report/s/methodology#tiers">tier thresholds</a>).</p><p style="color:#9aa4b2;font-size:.9rem"><a href="https://agenteconomy.report/s/changelog">Changelog of the method</a></p>

<h2>Signals</h2>
